# Simple Hash Preimage — "I know x such that H(x) == y"
#
# The simplest useful ZK proof: prove you know a secret
# whose hash matches a public value, without revealing the secret.
#
# This demonstrates: secret inputs, public inputs, hashing.

Secret Int Inputs: (x)
Public Int Inputs: (y)

compute: h = H(x)
check: y == h
